    "The choices seem to assume that enjoying melodic vocal albums means I want a broad range of older vocal hits, regardless of mood or musical style.",
    "My past Christmas listening seems to carry too much weight as a reason to choose more Christmas music on this visit."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My latest relaxing classical selection makes a gentle, soothing sound especially relevant to what I want next.",
    "The connection between expressive theatrical singing and classical crossover matters more to me than a shared association with familiar songs or greatest-hits collections."
